applied to the pinned commit by mineai/fetch-and-patch.sh (or scripts/mineai-fetch.mjs); git apply skips these lines.
0009: a block put down beside the bot (a temporary crafting table or furnace, a table for a craft, place_block's
nearby cell) never goes into a cell a mob or another player is in, and when one moves into the chosen cell before the
block goes down, that cell is left out and the next one is tried after a 4-tick pause (3 cells at most). Staging soak,
8 games at once, run 8: in a cave a bat flew into the cell chosen for the iron pickaxe's temporary table and the craft
failed in 1.3 s ("crafting_table: Placement cell (3, 51, 6322) overlaps bat #44444"). With tests (nearby-placement).

